  "_comment": [
    "Default symbol table for Apple IIgs hardware, ROM monitor,",
    "firmware entry points, and toolbox internals. Shipped with",
    "GSplus and auto-loaded on reset via the optional load_base",
    "field (no WDM $0F prologue required).",
    "",
    "Visibility is per-segment and can be gated on softswitch state:",
    "  shadow_mask / shadow_value: predicate on $C035.",
    "  statereg_mask / statereg_value: predicate on $C068.",
    "Segment active only when all predicates hold. See symbols.c.",
    "",
    "Bank-$E0/$E1 segments are unconditional (the real hardware and",
    "video memory live there). Bank-$00/$01 segments are aliases",
    "that only carry hardware meaning when shadowing is enabled",
    "for that region."
  ],
